ly grows under mountains and windswept hills.\"},\"gate\":{\"lockBadge\":\"Supporter perk\",\"titleV2\":\"See every diamond cluster on this seed.\",\"pillTitle\":\"Diamond Finder\",\"pillSub\":\"Supporter perk · 1 free scan\",\"bodyV2\":\"Pick diamond and the map marks the clusters — then go dig. Every other ore stays free, and supporting keeps the site running.\",\"cta\":\"Become a Supporter\",\"noteV2\":\"Not signed in yet? You sign in first (free), your pick is remembered, and checkout continues on your account page.\",\"noteV3\":\"Not signed in yet? You sign in first (free), and your pick is waiting on your account page.\",\"learnMoreV3\":\"See all plans\",\"demoBodyV2\":\"Pick a spot in your world. The map reveals the {count} diamond clusters closest to it — go dig and see they're real.\",\"demoX\":\"X\",\"demoZ\":\"Z\",\"demoCta\":\"Reveal {count} free clusters\",\"demoScanning\":\"Scanning around {x}, {z}… {pct}%\",\"demoErrorV2\":\"The scan did not finish. Try again in a moment.\",\"demoNoneFoundV2\":\"No diamond clusters within reach of {x}, {z}. Try a spot nearer your base.\",\"demoPill\":\"Free sample: {shown} of {total} clusters\",\"demoPillMore\":\"{more} more with Supporter\",\"demoHide\":\"Hide the free sample\",\"demoShowAgain\":\"Show my free sample again\",\"demoMoreLine\":\"{hidden} more clusters were found near ({x}, {z}) — Supporters see them all.\",\"demoUsedOther\":\"Your free sample was used on another seed. Supporters scan every seed, everywhere.\",\"demoUsedRemote\":\"Your free scan has already been used. Supporters scan without limits.\",\"demoIpCapV2\":\"The free scan has already been used from this network. Supporters scan without limits.\",\"demoOrUnlockV2\":\"Or unlock every cluster, on every seed\",\"demoMarkerTitle\":\"Free sample: diamond cluster\",\"badgeFreeScan\":\"1 free scan\",\"demoHead\":\"Try it free first\",\"demoOnce\":\"Once per account or device\",\"demoCoordNote\":\"Your base, a village — anywhere.\",\"demoRetry\":\"Try